# Full paradigm: nominative singular (1), then the paucal rule -- 2-4
# GENITIVE SINGULAR "sata", 5+ GENITIVE PLURAL "sati".  A naive gen.pl-only
# reading mislabels "sata" as the paucal, which is wrong: it is the
# genitive SINGULAR.  Wiktionary, sat, declension table --
# https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sat#Serbo-Croatian
sat
сат
sata
сата
sati
сати
